        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a personal PC role-playing stand alone game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will enter a feudal dynasty with an elevated history from the perspective of &quot;Bai Dixuan&quot;. From the birth of &quot;Bai Dixuan&quot; to his death, he has experienced how an aristocrat can realize his ideal and ambition in the face of disputes between the human state and the demon state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can players keep their original intention in the face of various temptations of fame and fortune? What is the secret behind the entanglement with the fate of the legendary &quot;Li Changsheng&quot;?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the path that is recognized in your heart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thick historical stories</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145250/extras/23d52e978af5232f1a6c71b089338d54.poster.avif?t=1766034973\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145250/extras/23d52e978af5232f1a6c71b089338d54.webm?t=1766034973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145250/extras/23d52e978af5232f1a6c71b089338d54.mp4?t=1766034973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is not a complete version, there are still many areas to be improved, and the content of the game is relatively barren, so please purchase with caution.</p>",
